---
description: Require a full site backup before any Kamra update or migrate on a live site
alwaysApply: true
---

# No backup, no update

Before any production or customer-trial Kamra update:

1. Run `bench --site <site> backup --with-files` (or `--site all`).
2. Confirm it succeeded and note the archive under `sites/<site>/private/backups`.
3. Only then pull / recreate / `bench migrate` / restart.

Docker path: `sudo /opt/kamra/install.sh update` already backs up first and **aborts if backup fails** — use that when the site was installed with `install.sh`.

If backup fails, stop. Do not migrate. Do not suggest an upgrade command that skips the backup step.
